Hi, if I’m not mistaken (which is entirely posible)…. You need to ude the mean shape of each species….not each individual on its own…. That’s what I did for my phylo analysis….
I input the whole data set and used it to build a new data set containing the mean shape for each species…and that is the dataset that I will merge with the phylogeny. Be careful, because the “mean shapes” need to have the same order in your arrangement as they have in the phylogeny….

Hope it helps

